  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening Humanitarian Efforts in Romania for Ukraine Crisis Relief</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project objective is to contribute to a reduction in the humanitarian vulnerability of people affected by the war in Ukraine through direct assistance and capacity strengthening initiatives in Romania. At the same time, the project aims to assist the Government in offering support to both refugees from Ukraine in Romania and Ukrainian civilian public servants and specialists to manage crises and their mobility dimensions. This will be done through a training programme meant to develop burnout mitigation and wellbeing plans to reduce the risk of burnout and compassion fatigue of first line civilian responders.</narrative>
  </description>
